{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Michelangelo made it, to see — by Michelangelo! Where else in Germany can one see a work by this master? — But to continue the report, we stayed overnight in Flamandsch Hooft (Tip of Flanders). — It is, as said, a pleasure to travel in this country; all the country roads are paved like the Königsstraße in Berlin, alongside the road are all fruit fields, gardens or meadows, and the highway is planted with trees. — From Aachen to Liège it swarms with beggars, up to here we have not met a single one; one sees adults and children in the villages only well-dressed and playing happily, no child in rags, none without shoes (many wooden shoes) and stockings, — we passed through a village of 15,000 inhabitants. —"}}],"created":1795220625,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":174,"prompt_tokens":270,"total_tokens":444,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-Dm2l4yxXjo4oJyX3RbSlLSRykHGWXf9C","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":270,"prompt_ms":446.092,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.6521925925925924,"prompt_per_second":605.2563148408849,"predicted_n":174,"predicted_ms":4027.526,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.280497109826587,"predicted_per_second":42.954409232864045}}